 '固定种子生成54个通用节点、3类节点轴的两条件无向加权网络，仅保留跨轴边。ggraph原生hive按两条件合并加权度的类内排名定位，节点坐标跨条件固定；边宽共用1-9尺度。下方3个分面给出同一54节点加权度，线型区分条件。网络无方向、无实际蛋白/调控身份；不由图形推断功能或因果。',c(hc,ec),
 list(hierarchy='Two native three-axisHive networks above three aligned class-specific weighted-degree profiles.',geometry='54nodes assignedto threeclassaxes;pooledstrength rank fixesidenticalcoordinates acrossconditions;nativeBezieredgesconnectonlydifferentaxes.',palette='Turquoise,clay andlavender identifythreeaxes;mutedpaircolorsseparateinter-axislinks;solid/dashedprofilesdistinguishconditions withoutrelyingoncolor.',typography='7pt Arial class/condition/profilelabels and9pt a-c tags at183x145mm.',marks='Native geom_edge_hive curves carry actualintegerweights onasharedscale;allnode degrees andprofilesderivefromsameedgeCSV.',annotation='Classlabels ataxisends;nodeposition decodingprovidedbyrankaxis below;nooverlaid nodeIDcloud,nocausal arrows orcanvasnotes.'),list(nodes=54,classes=3,edges_a=sum(edges$weight_a>0),edges_b=sum(edges$weight_b>0),axis_order='within-class pooled strength rank'),classes)
